+# Wire Format Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision designating a single wire serialisation format. The codebase (see `binding/` and `render/`) exposes JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, MsgPack, and ProtoBuf as interchangeable, caller-selected options for request binding and response rendering, but no ADR, policy document, or other recorded decision in this repository mandates one of these as the project's chosen wire format.
